</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>They said to Him, Yes, Lord!</l><l>Oh, Yes! Lord, oh, Yes, Lord!</l><l>Son of David, oh, Yes, Lord,</l><l>We think You can heal!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus reached out and touched them,</l><l>He touched them, He touched them,</l><l>And He said, as your faith is,</l><l>Be it done unto you.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, their eyes then were opened,</l><l>Were opened, were opened,</l><l>And according to their faith</l><l>It was done to those two!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
